        "Verge Shopping"
      ],
      "author": "Cameron Faulkner",
      "publishedAt": "2026-05-16T14:00:00.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/05/omniversusstealthpro2.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,10.728752477728,100,78.542495044544",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/gadgets/930828/turtle-beach-stealth-pro-2-steelseries-arctis-nova-pro-omni-gaming-headset-hands-on",
